sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(224,236,255) Ateleris
        participant report as Qualification Report
        participant sqt    as SQT Generic
    end

    box rgb(255,232,214) Klepsydra
        participant api   as Job API Server
        participant black  as AI Core · App Code · Hardware
    end

    Note over black: closed source - never crosses boundary

    sqt ->> api: GET /api/v1/docs
    api -->> sqt: StrictDoc documents<br/>(requirement UIDs + VERIFICATION methods)

    Note over sqt: parse requirements,<br/>split by VERIFICATION field
    rect rgb(210,220,245)
        Note over sqt: Testable reqs - VERIFICATION: Test

        sqt ->> api: POST /api/v1/jobs<br/>{ workload type, input data }
        api ->> black: execute
        Note over black: binary selection, packaging,<br/>pre/post-processing, hardware setup -<br/>all decided internally, never exposed
        black -->> api: output
        api -->> sqt: metrics { time.avg_ms, memory.peak_rss_kb, … }

        sqt ->> sqt: evaluate constraint
        sqt ->> report: PASS / FAIL
    end
    Note over report: PASS / FAIL / <br> COMPLIANT / UNCOVERED
